# Pure function

```ghost
fn hold(start: Bool, stop: Bool, previous: Bool) -> Bool {
  !stop && (start || previous)
}

control PureFunction {
  input start, stop: Bool;
  state running: Bool = false;
  running' = hold(start, stop, running);
}
```

